<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3828/33  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.8792/97  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.1161/81  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5304/14  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     38.79/84   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.3445/55  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1841.7/3.2 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     119.19/24  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     8.0567/42  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.7228/06  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.1625/45  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.5992/02</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$319.20/70</p>
</text>
